This is just a starting point and does not include all features such as advanced asynchronous resource downloading, filtering options, logging infrastructure, UI/UX design, security measures, modular architecture, automated testing framework, dynamic alerting system, or ethical scraping practices. Each of these features would require additional implementation.']",0,[0],[],True,0,0,0,

